### Graphviz Setup

If Graphviz is installed on Windows, add its `bin` directory to the system PATH.

Example:

```python
import os
os.environ["PATH"] += os.pathsep + r"C:\Program Files\Graphviz\bin"
```

Make sure the Graphviz installation path matches the location on your computer.

